      "reviewedAt": "2026-08-24T00:00:00Z",
      "note": "Reviewed the exploit and proxy-creation traces, commit-pinned reproduction, verified proxy and implementation source, complete proxy event interval, custom logic pointer, implementation runtime, and reported loss. The exploit delegates selfSwap to 0x33e690aea97e4ef25f0d140f1bf044d663091daf. logic() selects that address both at proxy deployment block 16635649 and immediately before the exploit; complete UpgradeProposed and UpgradedLogic log queries over blocks 16635649 through 16646023 returned no events. The implementation hash is unchanged from its deployment through the exploit and its runtime contains no SELFDESTRUCT, so proxy deployment is the latest executable-code selection event."
    },
